<h1>Rivet FTP</h1>
<p>Working name. It is not final. The repository currently calls it Rivet FTP.</p>
<p>
  A dual-pane file-transfer app for SFTP, FTP, and FTPS, built on Rivet's core and written in Rust
  and egui, with no GTK or Qt. This computer on one side, the server on the other, and a transfer
  queue. The same window is the connection manager for the <code>rivet-ftp</code> command. It is in
  progress. There is no release build yet.
</p>

